# MOODSPACE needs no API keys today: it runs entirely in the browser.
#
# If you add a service later, put its key in a file named .env.local (ignored by git),
# never in source code. Remember that any variable prefixed with VITE_ is bundled into
# the public JavaScript and can be read by every visitor — secret keys must stay on a
# server you control, not in this front-end.
#
# VITE_PUBLIC_EXAMPLE=value-that-is-safe-to-be-public
